1
00:00:00,996 --> 00:00:02,416
(Sheldon:)I don't know.

2
00:00:02,581 --> 00:00:04,791
(Sheldon:)I was on the Pasadena Freeway,
and missed my exit...

3
00:00:04,959 --> 00:00:08,419
(Sheldon:)...flew off the overpass,
and one thing led to another.

4
00:00:10,381 --> 00:00:12,841
Maybe you wanna give it a rest
and try again tomorrow.

5
00:00:13,008 --> 00:00:14,758
(Sheldon:)No. I quit.

6
00:00:16,387 --> 00:00:18,097
[CAR CRASHES AND MAN SCREAMS
ON SIMULATOR]

7
00:00:18,263 --> 00:00:19,553
[CROWD CLAMORING ON SIMULATOR]

8
00:00:19,723 --> 00:00:22,313
[ANIMALS CHIRPING AND WHIMPERING
ON SIMULATOR]

9
00:00:23,227 --> 00:00:25,977
Oh. The pet store?

10
00:00:27,231 --> 00:00:31,611
(Sheldon:)Remind me to compliment Wolowitz
on the software. It's amazingly detailed.

11
00:00:32,987 --> 00:00:34,947
So wait. You're just gonna give up?

12
00:00:35,114 --> 00:00:36,494
(Sheldon:)No, I'm not giving up.

13
00:00:36,657 --> 00:00:38,737
No, I never give up.

14
00:00:39,410 --> 00:00:41,240
(Leonard:)So, what is it you're doing?

15
00:00:41,745 --> 00:00:45,955
I'm, uh, transcending the situation.

16
00:00:49,253 --> 00:00:53,673
(Sheldon:)I'm clearly too evolved for driving.

17
00:00:56,010 --> 00:00:58,550
- What does that mean?
- Leonard...

